  "Question": "In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), \\(\\angle A=50^\\circ\\) and \\(\\angle B=60^\\circ\\). In \\(\\triangle DEF\\), \\(\\angle D=50^\\circ\\) and \\(\\angle F=70^\\circ\\). How are these two triangles related?",
